# Never commit credentials or agent state.
# These paths are excluded defensively — they are not stow packages, but a
# stray `cp -r` of ~/.pi or ~/.claude into this repo must not leak secrets.
**/auth.json
**/.credentials.json
**/credentials
**/.aws/cli/
**/*.key
**/cookies.json
.claude.json
.claude.json.backup.*

# Local agent/tool state that is machine-specific, not config.
**/sessions/
**/projects/
**/trust.json
**/models-store.json
**/history.jsonl
**/*.log
nvim/.config/nvim/lazy-lock.json
